# A rebind that only relabels the binding and version keeps membership the old
# filter extracted.
MODULE: QuiescentExactRebindWithoutScan
TARGET: QuiescentExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the rebind adopts the new version and binding but keeps the old membership instead of rescanning
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ ~Live
    /\ Rebuild(epoch + 1)
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Live
    /\ bound' = phys /\ viewDefn' = defn
    /\ UNCHANGED <<epoch, read, checkpoint, phase, mem, slots, pub, intent,
         registry>>
--- END
